OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-million pound project to
OL,4,Adetect dementia
OL,5,
OL,6,FA multi-million pound research hub is
OL,7,Fset to build artificial intelligence
OL,8,F(AI) and data systems in a bid to
OL,9,Fprevent and detect dementia.
OL,11,FThe BRAINIAC Hub, led by the University
OL,12,Fof Exeter, is funded by #10m from the
OL,13,FEngineering and Physical Sciences
OL,14,FResearch Council (EPSRC), part of UK
OL,15,FResearch and Innovation. Another #10m
OL,16,Fwill be contributed by industry,
OL,17,Fcharity and NHS partners.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
