OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-million pound project to
OL,4,Adetect dementia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university said the hub would
OL,7,Fdevelop AI combining brain imaging,
OL,8,Fgenetics, blood biomarkers and digital
OL,9,Fcognitive tests into a "single, clear
OL,10,Fpicture of a person's brain health".
OL,12,FThe funding covers a six year project
OL,13,Fwith the first clinics to start
OL,14,Foperating in 2029, initially open to
OL,15,Fpeople via NHS referral.
